### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### Query - Single Question
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is a RAG system?"
}

###

### Query - Complex Question
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does retrieval-augmented generation improve LLM responses?"
}

###

### Query - Empty Question (Error Test)
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}

###

### Ingest Documents
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest-documents

###

### Ingest URL
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest-url?url=https://example.com

###

### Root Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8000/
